https://github.com/taurusxin/ncmdump
LuSound uses an independent Kotlin reader and in-memory Media3 data source; no ncmdump executable is bundled.

LRC parser in app.lusound.metadata.Lyrics.kt adapted from Convx LyricsUtils.kt (same upstream baseline, GPL-3.0), reduced to standard LRC with offset handling. Metadata services: LRCLIB (https://github.com/tranxuanthang/lrclib), MusicBrainz and Cover Art Archive (https://github.com/metabrainz/libcoverart). FLAC tags are read by AndroidX Media3 FlacMetadataReader.
Opencc4j (https://github.com/houbb/opencc4j), Apache-2.0, supplies offline Simplified/Traditional Chinese conversion on all supported Android versions.
